                  jobDomainSC.getString("JDP.userUpdate") + "..."));
          request.setAttribute(MIN_LENGTH_LOGIN_ATTR, jobDomainSC.getMinLengthLogin());
          request.setAttribute(CURRENT_USER_ATTR, jobDomainSC.getUserDetail());

